\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Ask someone what a textile conservator does for a living and you\u8217 ll probably get a shrug of the shoulders. Yet these craftswomen are responsible for bringing ancient history back to life. Most of their work is unseen or secretly hidden in a glamorous display of ancient clothing that hangs majestically in a museum.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\ql\faauto\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb240\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0
